            <note corresp="#d297-f1" n="3" type="source" xml:id="d297-f1-content">
                <p>The same, <hi rendition="#italic">mutatis mutandis</hi>, to the French, Russian,
                    and Italian Ambassadors and the Belgian Minister.</p>
            </note>
